  "description": "Hye-Min Lee is your typical high school student, complete with a pet cat and an annoying older brother. But when the shapeshifting villainess Nero unleashes a cat the size of an apartment building to terrorize Hye-Min’s hometown, Hye-Min comes into possession of a magical watch and finds her true calling: she must join the fight against feline foes and become a Meow Ranger.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
